      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm always having trouble finding friends buried in avatar tags, I feel like my name tag is too big.\n\nEven if there is an option to reduce the size of the name tag by reducing the size of the name tag itself, so that the size of the name tag changes depending on the size of the avatar and the distance between players (to prevent it from becoming too small) Sounds good.\n\nName tags are just too big to get close and talk.",
